{
  "id": 146429699,
  "iid": 6493,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "sharkd: Remove json newline restriction",
  "description": "Remove the restriction of having the json string on a single line.\n\nValid json string input would now be:\n```\n{\n   \"jsonrpc\": \"2.0\"\n  , \"id\": 1\n  , \"method\":\"status\"\n}\n{\"jsonrpc\": \"2.0\",\"id\": 1, \"method\":\"status\"}{\"jsonrpc\": \"2.0\",\"id\": 1,\n\"method\":\"status\"\n}{\"jsonrpc\": \"2.0\",\"id\": 1,\"method\":\"status\"}\n```\n\nNote: This also needs to be updated in the documentation;\nhttps://wiki.wireshark.org/Development/sharkd#request-syntax\n\nCloses #17823",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2022-03-22T17:20:29.333Z",
