      "title": "sharkd: Remove json newline restriction",
      "message": "sharkd: Remove json newline restriction\n\nRemove the restriction of having the json string on one line. See issue #17823\nValid json string input would now be:\n{\n   \"jsonrpc\": \"2.0\"\n  , \"id\": 1\n  , \"method\":\"status\"\n}\n{\"jsonrpc\": \"2.0\",\"id\": 1, \"method\":\"status\"}{\"jsonrpc\": \"2.0\",\"id\": 1,\n\"method\":\"status\"\n}{\"jsonrpc\": \"2.0\",\"id\": 1,\"method\":\"status\"}\n",
      "author_name": "m.kaldenbach",
      "author_email": "m.kaldenbach@wearetriple.com",
